        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Cloud Form"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, polymorph)\n\nThe nue changes its shape into that of a dark storm cloud. In Cloud Form, the nue is concealed, gains a 60-foot fly Speed, gains a +4 status bonus to its Deception DC to prevent others from seeing through its disguise, and can't make attacks, though it can use its howl abilities. The nue can Dismiss this effect."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
