              "value": []
            },
            "id": "15c97075-553e-4632-ae20-7e2f6022fbbe",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:05.144783"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Monstrous Howl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, mental, void)\n\nThe nue lets out an eerie howl that rattles creatures' very souls. Creatures within 60 feet must attempt a 27 Will save (29 at night). They're then temporarily immune to Monstrous Howl for 10 minutes.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 2d8 persistent void damage.\n- **Failure:** As success, plus the target is drained 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** As success, plus the target is drained 2 and stunned 1."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "05b74033-d5b5-4ffd-b81c-6821fd4cef05",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:05.144783"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Thundering Howl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(electricity)\n\nThe nue howls to the sky, calling down a bolt of lightning that strikes the creature closest to the nue, to a maximum range of 60 feet. The bolt deals 12d6 electricity damage (27 basic Reflex save). The nue then can't use Thundering Howl for 1d4 rounds."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
